              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bab. 25.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lundi Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Khare omwami Farao Nofura, omwami owa Misiri mu bunyali bwe basiku bewe nende khwaabo bayiima khumwiira niye, bulayi bwene nga nara Sedekia, omwami owa Yuda mu bunyali bwa Nebukadinesa, omwami owa Babiloni, owaba omusiku wewe mala owayiimanga khumwiira.”",
          "type": "text",
